'''Nikilis''' was a [[Default Knife]] skin made by [[didi1147]]. It was designed and published on March 6, 2016 and was most likely meant to be added to the game. However, due to unknown circumstances, it was scrapped and never was released.

==Appearance==
It appears to resemble [[Nikilis]], hence the name. Its blade is bright yellow in color with a red sparkle time fedora imprinted on the tip. In the center of the blade is a pair of 8-bit blue sunglasses, and the ricasso of the blade is red in color with a bloxcon trophy imprinted on it. The guard is red in color, and the handle is solid black with a slight red tint.

